1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,933
You're late. Hall pass?

2
00:00:02,433 --> 00:00:06,267
A girl in a paper mask. Eleven years
old. A roll book under her arm.

3
00:00:06,767 --> 00:00:09,167
I'm Junie. I run the morning. Did you
wash?

4
00:00:09,667 --> 00:00:14,433
Rule two. Hands first. Soap, twenty
seconds, before you touch your face.

5
00:00:14,933 --> 00:00:17,433
Sing the alphabet twice. Mister Frank
timed it.

6
00:00:17,933 --> 00:00:19,733
Locker sixty-seven. Of course.
